
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Smart Deals Store | Best Products</title>
<meta name="description" content="Discover useful products, gadgets and deals. Shop through our Amazon affiliate links.">

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f4f6f9;
  color: #172033;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

header {
  background: #131921;
  color: white;
  padding: 18px 6%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #ffb84d;
}

nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin: 8px;
}

.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, #10243d, #286078);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 60px 15px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 45px);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.hero p {
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.search {
  width: min(550px, 95%);
  padding: 14px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.section {
  padding: 35px 6%;
}

.section h2 {
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.categories {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.category {
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  background: white;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.category.active,
.category:hover {
  background: #ffb84d;
}

.products {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
  gap: 22px;
}

.card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 15px #00000010;
  transition: transform .2s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 200px;
  object-fit: contain;
  background: #fff;
  padding: 12px;
}

.card-content {
  padding: 17px;
}

.card h3 {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.card p {
  color: #596273;
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.buy {
  display: block;
  background: #ffb84d;
  color: #172033;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.buy:hover {
  background: #f5a623;
}

.empty {
  display: none;
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

.notice {
  background: #fff5df;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-top: 25px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

footer {
  background: #131921;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px 15px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}

footer a {
  color: #ffb84d;
  margin: 8px;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  header {
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  nav a {
    margin: 5px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">Smart Deals</div>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#products">Products</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <h1>Discover Amazing Products</h1>
  <p>Explore useful gadgets, electronics and everyday essentials.</p>

  <input
    id="search"
    class="search"
    type="search"
    placeholder="Search products..."
    aria-label="Search products"
  >
</section>

<main>
<section class="section" id="products">
  <h2>Explore Our Products</h2>

  <div class="categories">
    <button class="category active" data-category="All">All</button>
    <button class="category" data-category="Electronics">Electronics</button>
    <button class="category" data-category="Home">Home</button>
    <button class="category" data-category="Accessories">Accessories</button>
  </div>

  <div class="products" id="product-list">

    <article class="card" data-category="Electronics">
      <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Wireless+Headphones"
           alt="Wireless headphones">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Wireless Headphones</h3>
        <p>Explore wireless headphones and compare available options.</p>
        <a class="buy" href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=wireless+headphones"
           target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">View on Amazon</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card" data-category="Electronics">
      <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Smart+Watch"
           alt="Smart watch">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Smart Watch</h3>
        <p>Discover smart watches for daily use and fitness tracking.</p>
        <a class="buy" href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=smart+watch"
           target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">View on Amazon</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card" data-category="Home">
      <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Home+Organizer"
           alt="Home organizer">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Home Organizer</h3>
        <p>Find storage and organization products for your home.</p>
        <a class="buy" href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=home+organizer"
           target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">View on Amazon</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card" data-category="Accessories">
      <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Phone+Accessories"
           alt="Phone accessories">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Phone Accessories</h3>
        <p>Explore phone stands, cases and useful mobile accessories.</p>
        <a class="buy" href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=phone+accessories"
           target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">View on Amazon</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card" data-category="Electronics">
      <img src="https://placehold.co/400x300?text=Bluetooth+Speaker"
           alt="Bluetooth speaker">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Bluetooth Speaker</h3>
